<script setup lang="ts">import type {Result} from '../types/domain';import {travel} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{result:Result}>();</script><template><div class="phase-compare"><div class="comparison-header"><span>同一边快照</span><span>最大流 / 箱每小时</span><span>最小割 / 箱每小时</span><span>独立最短时长</span></div><div v-for="key in ['baseline','outage'] as const" :key="key" :class="['phase-row',key]"><b>{{key==='baseline'?'基线网络':'停用方案'}}</b><strong>{{result[key].max_flow.value}}</strong><strong>{{result[key].max_flow.cut_capacity}}</strong><strong class="time">{{travel(result[key].shortest.minutes)}}</strong></div><p>最大流减少{{result.impact.flow_reduction}}箱/小时；{{result.impact.lost_reachability?'停用后不可达':result.impact.shortest_time_change_minutes==null?'最短时长不可比较':'最短时长变化 '+result.impact.shortest_time_change_minutes.toFixed(2)+' 分钟'}}。最短路与最大流分配分别计算。</p></div></template>
